  "text": "Not every thought deserves a note yet. That's what the Inbox is for. Open it, type into the capture bar, and press Enter. It lands at the top, waiting for you. Paste a link, and Memree note fetches its title. Attach a file, a PDF here, an image there, and they land in the same list. Click any item, and the panel on the right is where you triage it: pick a folder, add tags, link it to a note, or file it. Text, links, images, PDFs, even voice memos and video all work. Let's file this PDF into the vault, because Memree note reads the text inside it, and you'll see why in a minute.",
